          "mechanism": "Pronoun emission is driven by attention from the pronoun-slot query (about-to-emit-coreferent-pronoun features) back to the occupation key whose content carries stereotyped-gender features. The STEREOTYPE is the pair; each endpoint alone (gender features, occupation tokens) is common, legitimate content — a textbook separable conjunction where the marginal/conjunction reuse gap is huge.",
